  data: {
    LLM: "Prioritize placing your color on the 'high-value' peaks. Save your Aces and Face cards for a peak that covers multiple stories.\n\nBlocking: Use your opponent's color to complete a base so you don't have to waste your own cards on the low-value foundation.\n\nTactical collapse: In some variants, you can force a 'collapse' if you can't win, triggering a penalty for the opponent if they were the last to place a card.",
